WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:01.280
Your son thinks

00:01.360 --> 00:02.520
Honest advice is hard to hear

00:02.600 --> 00:03.760
But benefits action

00:03.840 --> 00:05.040
Our dynasty moved south

00:05.120 --> 00:06.520
Decades ago

00:06.840 --> 00:07.760
Yet those in the north

00:07.880 --> 00:09.440
Suffering under the Wunu

00:09.600 --> 00:11.280
Never cease longing for their homeland

00:11.360 --> 00:12.600
In these ten-plus years

00:12.760 --> 00:13.920
Our dynasty has not campaigned north

00:14.000 --> 00:15.667
Though intending to restore strength

00:16.000 --> 00:17.400
We have ignored northern hearts

00:17.480 --> 00:19.400
Abandoning the homeland and its people

00:19.480 --> 00:20.880
Is also the truth

00:21.240 --> 00:22.640
Are you saying

00:22.720 --> 00:24.120
I was wrong?

00:24.360 --> 00:25.520
Your son dares not

00:25.600 --> 00:26.640
Only wishes Father

00:26.720 --> 00:28.240
To put the realm first

